name suppress-quiet-1
timeout 120

# SUPPRESSED IS NOT DESTROYED — the objective kind that makes the two words two words.
# doc/air-to-ground.md §5.2.
#
# `objective suppress unit <callsign> [emitting <s>]` is fulfilled when the named unit's CUMULATIVE
# RADIATING TIME over the run stays at or below the allowance. It is a BEHAVIOUR, not a damage state:
# it is scored against an OBSERVED bit on a published signature — the same class of fact as a health
# bit — and never by a new FBSystemId (the health register is monotone by contract and suppression is
# not) nor by widening CombatEffective() (which is a statement about airframes and is read for every
# unit in the tree). It passes doc/missions/verdict.md's own test: the judge measures what was DONE,
# and the declaring unit is never asked what it heard.
#
# HERE the battery is briefed off the air at t = 25 against a 30 s allowance and never comes back. It
# ends the run STRUCTURALLY INTACT, which is exactly the outcome a suppression sortie is supposed to be
# able to score and which `objective kill` cannot express.
#
# THE FALSE POSITIVE IS NAMED RATHER THAN HIDDEN: a site that was never woken scores a suppression
# nobody earned — the exact dual of `deny release` scoring a jettisoning striker as denied. That is why
# `suppress` is only a result when it is paired with something the attacker did, and why this file
# flies an armed weasel past the position instead of an empty sky.
#
# WHAT TO READ:
#   events.log      `site GO_DARK why="emission plan"` at t = 25, then
#                   `mission SUPPRESSED target="suppress unit sam emitting 30" emittingS=25 allowanceS=30`
#   UNIT_RESULT     sam INTACT — the position is quiet AND standing
#
# READING RULE: exit 0 = SUCCESS is the pass, and the MEASUREMENT is the `mission SUPPRESSED` line
# beside `UNIT_RESULT unit=sam result=INTACT`. Read beside suppress-killed.fbm, where the same
# objective is met the other way and `kill` is met with it.

runway 46.84335 6.91523 441.0 228.0 2889

unit weasel
  module f16
  team friendly
  spawn 46.63000 6.90000 4000 0.0 450
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 60
  set fcr_mode off
  set rwr on
  set store 3 agm88
  set arm_class any
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set task route
  wp 47.20000 6.90000 4000 450
  objective suppress unit sam emitting 30
  objective survive

unit sam
  module sa6
  team hostile
  spawn 46.719640 6.907845 ground 0.0 0     # 10 km ahead of the weasel
  set emcon free 25                          # briefed off the air at 25 s
  set rounds 0
